  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "scope": "Repair npm/browser hosted acceptance defaults to resolve relative to the checkout while honoring explicit runtime overrides. Retain TAP outside the test-reset output directory, restore the acceptance log on success and failure, and propagate the exact failed producer status. Reproduce both observed bugs without installed builds and preserve fail-closed workflow controls. Refresh exactly 92 consumer-workflow live source pins; preserve every other inventory byte, original receipt, archive, support claim and execution record. Hosted installed acceptance remains required.",
